 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Proximity Mines icon0}}
| desc = Plant an invisible mine that cannot be detected by True Sight, but is visible if an enemy is within the active 500 AoE of the mine. Mines detonate if an enemy is standing within the active AoE for 1 seconds dealing damage and temporarily reducing the enemy's Magic Resistance. The explosion deals full damage if the target is within 150 radius and decreases down to 50% on the edge. Deals 30% damage to buildings.
}}
* {{Symbol|a|Down}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance}}
** {{Symbol|bonus buildings}}
*** Affected [[buildings]] now have {{calc|1-(1-0)*(1+v1)|v1={{#var:Proximity Mines type1 value5}}|%}} [[magic resistance]].
*** Hence, each Proximity Mine deals a max {{calc|(1+v1)*v2|v1={{#var:Proximity Mines type1 value5}}|v2={{#var:Proximity Mines type1 value4}}}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} to buildings.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} 
*** Affected enemy heroes now have {{Code|{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1+v1)|v1={{#var:Proximity Mines type1 value5}}|%}} + {{calc|v1*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}|v1={{#var:Proximity Mines type1 value5}}|%}} × Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]}} magic resistance.

